  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, Financing Resilient Futures in the Asia-Pacific Small Island Developing States (SIDS), is designed to strengthen the capacity of SIDS in the Asia-Pacific region to mobilize and manage financial resources for climate change adaptation, disaster risk reduction, and sustainable development. Recognizing the unique vulnerabilities of these island nations ranging from economic fragility to extreme climate impacts, the initiative aims to enhance resilience by integrating sustainable financ</narrative>
  </description>
